# Smart-MCP Environment Configuration
# =====================================
#
# REPO_PATH — which project smart-mcp should index.
#
# ⚠️  For MULTI-PROJECT use (recommended):
#     Leave REPO_PATH commented out.
#     Smart-MCP auto-detects the project from the folder you open in Claude Code.
#     Run setup_global.py once and you're done — works across all projects.
#
# For SINGLE PROJECT (optional override):
#     Uncomment and set REPO_PATH below.
#     This takes priority over auto-detection.
#
# Resolution order (highest to lowest priority):
#   1. CLI argument       python -m app.mcp.server <path>
#   2. AI client env var  CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR / VSCODE_WORKSPACE_FOLDER / PROJECT_ROOT / …
#   3. This env var       REPO_PATH below (only if uncommented)
#   4. Auto-detect cwd    ← used when you run setup_global.py (recommended)
#
# REPO_PATH=C:\Work\YourProject
